{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n やりたいことたくさんあるけど、\n いざお休みの日になると\n なーんにもできないぐうたら人間こと、\n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33P8CVH5T1YMZZBT2E869C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n がー🦕パジャマ大好きです💕\n \n \n \n 本日14時から\n \n 2ndシングルの握手会の応募が始まってます😳\n \n 10月までの会う約束ができるなんて〜〜\n 嬉しいですね🦒💕\n \n \n \n \n 少しでも気になっている方や、\n 少しでも話したいことがあるっていう方！\n 会いに来てくださるとうれしいです！！\n \n \n 季節的に、浴衣を着たり、\n ハロウィンの仮装をしたり\n しようかな〜〜考えています🧚‍♀️\n 私は毎回お洋服にテーマを決めているのです！\n お楽しみに！\n \n \n 是非たくさんの方とお話ししたいです！\n よろしくお願いします💗\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33P9DS1C657P6RQA45Y8GK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33PAD4PS4YXTBR5EERGB0N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 待ってます🌞\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 2日の握手会のお話〜\n \n 1部🐡\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33PBE059680TGGT60CBYTF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33PCCVRJRDT4QHHCCEQT26","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 最近ハマってるヘアピン！\n \n 空色ワンピースは\n 韓国に一人旅行った時に買いました〜〜✈️\n あんまりこういう可愛らしい感じ\n 普段着ないので少し緊張しました〜〜どうですか？\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33PDCKKEJ50WVK3ST2SFC3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 湖のほとりに立っていそうな\n 女の子をイメージしたので\n テーマは「思い出のクーミー」でした👒\n \n \n 2部🐡\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33PEGNPYXY1X5M6Z3QQ0ZX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 麦わらベレー帽にしました！\n これはメチャカリです😚\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33PFNC59S27B790B05NDDG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n にぶちゃんがたくさん写真撮ってくれたよ〜〜\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33PGN2H8GXDNSMBM9A5TSA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33PHKYW8B2R0P7ZN0G8VMK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33PJJWC488Z9KDGGC9MWA4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33PKMF35TYPE89CSRDRX3V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33PMQ3H25GGD5HND6CQCPS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n もりねえと私宛のお花まで😢💕\n 大好きなひまわりもたくさんありがとうございます💕\n \n \n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33PNR6PW2TG23S83AGY2WY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 夢で逢いましょう〜〜☁️\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}